WEBVTT

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.700
Momo?

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.370
It seems... I really was
your mortal enemy this whole time.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.700
I'm going home now.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.790
Momo!

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:18.700
Momo...

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.450
Dad was sealed away...

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.200
I'm sorry that I never told you.

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:29.750
Because you're so frail,
I was afraid that burdening you with all this

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.700
might cause you to work yourself ragged
and eventually fall apart.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:36.000
Now that you've awakened your Demon powers,
you need to become strong

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.290
in order to protect yourself
if you want to pave a path into the future.

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:43.540
But it was terribly insincere of me to pressure you
to do your best, without telling you the whole truth.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.370
You tried hard to protect me
even though I had been lying to you.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:50.540
I now realize that I wasn't putting my utmost faith in you.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.120
Mom...

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:56.250
Anyway, starting from today
this will now be known as the "Daddy Box!"

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:59.000
Uh, I think I'm going to need a little more time
to process this revelation.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.950
We can finally make some offerings to him as a family!

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:11.330
MIKAN

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:04.660
The Daddy Box is built tough
and any stains get automatically purified,

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:07.330
so let's continue to use it
as a stool and table just like always.

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:08.660
Are you sure that's okay?!

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:11.330
Your father was the type
that put things to use in any way he could.

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:14.330
BRING IT ON!

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:14.160
Everything okay! Bring it on!

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:18.120
Now then, I have some more things
about your father that I want to tell you.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:19.200
Listen closely, Yuko.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.000
Okay.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.500
Do you remember anything about your father?

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.040
Not much.

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:27.910
That makes sense. You were almost always sleeping
back when he was around.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:30.870
But I do remember that he used
to pat me on the head sometimes.

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.620
Your father had quite the pair of horns on his head.

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:39.450
So this is what he looked like back in the day.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.910
He's so much shorter than mom!

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:45.250
I must have inherited my short stature from him!

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:46.910
I probably won't get any taller, even if I undo the seal!

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:48.250
Are you okay, Yuko?

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.750
Doesn't dad seem pretty young here?
He looks around the same age I am!

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:53.910
Your father has always had
an incredibly youthful complexion.

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:55.000
I'll give this back now!

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.950
By the way, I've pretty much stopped aging
ever since I became his vassal.

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:58.620
"Vassal"?

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:01.330
A vassal is someone that has forged a bond
with another through a contract...

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:05.000
Wait a second. Maybe it's better to say
that it's a type of blood relation via magic.

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:05.700
VASSAL

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:05.700
A SUBSERVIENT MEMBER OF A CLAN OR FAMILY.
ORIGINALLY USED TO REFER TO EMISSARIES OF GOD.
IT CAN MEAN: RELATIVES, KINSFOLK,
FOLLOWERS, SERVANTS, OR ANY SORT
OF DEPENDENT RELATIONSHIP.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:05.700
Overload...

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:05.700
OVERLOAD

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:06.700
OVERLOAD

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:08.330
Are you all right, Yuko?

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:10.660
Um, I'm still in a state of shock to be honest.

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:15.750
So much... so much... so much...

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:14.330
Ever since I grew these horns,
there's just been so much going on.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:16.830
Scuttle, scuttle, scuttle, scuttle.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.580
I think I've gotten accustomed
to dealing with surprises, lately.

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:24.040
Yuko! You've really started to take after your father!

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.500
Bring it on...

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:25.750
BRING
IT
ON

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.160
And really...

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.750
I'm relieved that dad hasn't died or anything.

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:36.910
And now I know that I'm in good health
thanks to the help of many different people.

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:38.290
I...

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:43.700
I think I've finally figured out a reason to fight.

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:48.080
Mom, I'm going to chase after Momo.

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.200
I don't want her to fret over all this on her own.

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:53.450
Momo has been my mortal enemy
ever since the moment I first laid eyes on her.

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:57.000
I'll chase her to the ends of the Earth
until I can finally claim victory over her!

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:01.790
You're going to regret all that time you spent
helping me build up stamina, Momo!

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:04.330
Now I'm going to have my revenge
for the tire and all that other stuff you did!

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:05.290
"Tire and other stuff"?

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:06.080
Mom.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:06.700
Yes?

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:11.200
Please share some more stories about dad with me later.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:13.660
I'm headed out!

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:14.620
Sure.

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:19.700
Yuko, I imagine you probably don't remember this...

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.620
...but there's something
that your father used to say to you.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.620
She's already gone.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:29.500
I'll just have to tell her some other time.

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:43.540
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:46.500
Taiyou mabushisugite
The sun is shining too brightly

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:49.370
(Chikachika me o kosutta)
(I rubbed my eyes from the glare)

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:52.290
Omowazu tobidashita yo
I took off without even thinking

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.830
(Dokidoki no hajimiari sa)
(It's time for us to spark the joy)

00:03:54.830 --> 00:04:00.580
Yurayura yureru maegami hidarite de osaetara
When I hold back my swaying bangs with my left hand

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:05.160
Itsumo no keshiki ga kirameku yo
These familiar sights start to shine

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:06.370
(Three, two, one)

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:11.410
Ima sugu tsutaetai futari no himitsu
We want to share our secret, right now

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:17.910
Watashitachi nara dekiru yo
Anything is possible for us

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:17.910
(Itsumo tonari ni ite)
(Always stay by my side)

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:20.080
Kitto
For sure

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:20.580
(Shijiteru kara)
(We trust each other)

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:26.540
Machikado de mitsuketa daiji na takaramono
On that street corner we found a precious treasure

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:32.370
Tatoe kimi ga tooku hanaretemo kanarazu oikakeru yo
Even if you went far away, I would definitely run after you

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:38.450
Zutto kagayaiteru mirai wa koko ni aru
Our future is here, forever burning bright

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:43.660
Otanoshimi wa kore kara
The fun is only just getting started

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:04.950
Feelings to Convey!!
A New Leap Forward for Demonkind!!

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.540
The Demon Girl and the Magical Girl
share a surprising intertwined fate.

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:12.830
Shamiko, now is the time for you
to chase after that Magical Girl!

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:17.700
Where exactly did Momo disappear to?

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.450
Maybe I should start by checking out her house.

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:24.200
Shamiko.... Hey Shamiko...

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:28.790
Dog

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:25.410
MUNCH

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:25.870
MUNCH

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:26.410
MUNCH

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:28.160
A-Ancestor!

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:26.910
MUNCH

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:27.450
MUNCH

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:28.080
MUNCH

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:28.790
MUNCH

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:31.370
Ancestor...

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:31.790
PAT
PAT

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:35.290
It's my fault that you got all messed up like this!
Did you lose some weight?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:32.290
PAT
PAT

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:33.040
PAT
PAT

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:33.540
PAT
PAT

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:34.540
PAT
PAT

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:35.040
PAT
PAT

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:38.660
Shamiko, that's a dog toy you're holding. I'm over here!

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:35.790
PAT
PAT

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:36.290
PAT
PAT

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:36.790
PAT
PAT

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:38.790
PAT
PAT

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:43.500
SUPER MOVE! MAGICAL GIRL HURL!

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:42.200
After being flung away by the Magical Girl
in the last episode, the ancestor has been rescued.

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.500
Good work, Shamiko!

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:47.750
Your father was connected
to the currently missing Sakura Chiyoda...

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:50.790
...and the barrier that surrounds this city. I see.

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:53.540
Did you know about what happened
to my father, Ancestor?

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:57.040
Actually, I don't really know anything
about your father or his history.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.790
I was really curious and tried
to bring it up with you more than once,

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.750
but every time I was unable to get through Seiko's guard.

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:06.910
Ancestor... if you run your mouth too much
and cause Shamiko to fall sick or get depressed,

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:09.000
I'll send you to a temple
that performs funerals for old toys!

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:10.200
Funerals for old toys?!

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:15.660
Authentic
Japanese Shochu
Glug
Glug

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:14.500
If you play your cards right, I'll prepare
a small reservoir of sake for you to partake in every day.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:15.700
Sake is so tasty...

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:18.700
I just... I couldn't... Sob, sob.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:20.660
Don't cry, Ancestor!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:26.120
Right now, I need to focus on cornering Momo.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:30.700
From what I understood, Ms. Sakura Chiyoda
is the person I owe for making me healthy again.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:34.120
But... I get the feeling Momo didn't see things that way.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:39.700
I think that if I just left her alone,
Momo would disappear and I'd never see her again.

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:42.450
Shamiko?

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:48.700
That's why I'm going to return the favor by dragging
Momo back and then helping her search for Ms. Sakura.

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:49.660
But...

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:54.790
TREMBLE
TREMBLE
TREMBLE
TREMBLE

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:53.540
Even if I do manage to grab hold of her,
I couldn't stop her from turning the tables on me...

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:56.040
Worst case scenario,
she flings me as high as the heavens.

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:59.450
Are you telling me you charged out here
with no plan at all?!

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:03.910
I think Momo probably got close to me
to try and get some info about her sister.

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:06.790
But unfortunately, the one lead she finally found
wasn't able to provide any answers.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:09.950
She must be really depressed
about having been sent back to square one.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:13.200
I don't think she'll be willing
to work together with me anymore.

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:17.200
Think about it this way, Shamiko. If Momo is feeling down
right now, then it's a chance we can't pass up!

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:21.700
You're my descendant and you have the ability
to get into people's hearts and freely manipulate them.

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:22.870
In theory, anyway.

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:23.620
"Theory"?

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:26.450
It's simple... all you need to do is seduce Momo Chiyoda!

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:27.910
"Seduce"?!

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:31.540
She's not here, either.

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:33.290
No pink heads that I can see.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:34.790
Oh? If it isn't Shamiko.

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:37.370
Oh! Hello Mikan.
You don't look too good.

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:39.040
You should take a dose of vitamin C!

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:48.290
MYSTERIOUS

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:40.580
Actually, what good timing.

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:42.040
Come on! Just eat this! It's a citrus fruit that I just bought!

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:42.790
Can you tell me the places that Momo might go to?

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:43.700
Huh? What for?

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:46.910
I'm looking for Momo and I have to find her
as quickly as possible.

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:48.200
You're looking for her?

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:51.830
Is that true?

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:53.500
Ms. Sakura disappeared?

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.580
Huh? Didn't you know, Mikan?

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:59.620
Th-th-th-this is the first I'm hearing about it!

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.450
Uh, Mikan please keep your cool!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.120
Why did Momo hide it all from me?

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.830
Mikan... stay in control...!

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:11.660
Why didn't she just tell me?

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:14.160
Crisis Management!

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:33.000
98 cents
(98 yen)

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:31.200
Mikan...

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:35.620
I owe Ms. Sakura a lot, too.

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:39.000
Why won't Momo rely on me? I thought we were friends.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.120
Hey, Mikan.

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:41.200
Shamiko?

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.700
As another of Momo's friends-

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:47.700
I mean mortal enemy, I'm equally frustrated
that she's choosing to run away.

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:50.120
Oh no, did my curse hit you again? I'm sorry.

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:51.330
Huh? 98 cents?

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:52.830
Please tell me what you know about Momo!

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:54.290
I have to find her no matter what!

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.200
Shamiko...

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:02.000
If it's true that Ms. Sakura vanished over 10 years ago,

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:05.160
that would have been
after she left Momo in a different city.

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:07.870
Even if Momo wanted to look for her,
she wouldn't have any leads to go off of.

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:11.290
Assuming there is a Demon in the city old enough
to remember exactly what happened,

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:15.250
it doesn't matter since the barrier here
prevents Magical Girls from encountering Demons.

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:16.950
Yeah, Momo mentioned that to me.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:17.540
Huh?

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:20.790
But on the day that I became a Demon Girl,
I encountered Momo right away.

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:21.700
She stopped it with one hand?

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:24.000
Yeah, about that...

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:27.830
...you mentioned earlier that Metako said he could sense
Sakura Chiyoda's presence in you, right?

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:28.500
Right.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:32.750
Like I said, it's usually impossible for any Demon
and any Magical Girl to cross paths in this city.

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:34.000
Right.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.950
That's why I think your meeting with Momo
must have been some kind of fated event.

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:39.700
A mysterious power might have been at work
behind the scenes somehow.

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:41.580
"Fated event"...

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:45.330
Well, that's just a guess.
It might actually be a simple coincidence.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:48.000
It's true that the barrier on our house had grown weaker.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:50.290
I wonder if that was also due to the hand of fate?

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:51.450
Shamiko.

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:54.200
I can think of one place that Momo might have gone to.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.160
But you should go by yourself to look for her there.

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:58.540
Huh? Why is that?

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:02.370
Well, I mean, if I overhear your conversation
then it might make me lose control of all my nerves!

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.450
Okay, I get it! You're already starting to lose it!

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:09.160
Tama River

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.080
But I want to hear all the details from you afterwards!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.580
Okay, sure!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.160
Shamiko, save me! I'm going to go flying!

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:16.950
I finally found you, Magical Girl!

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:19.620
I'm impressed you knew to come here.

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:23.330
Mikan was kind enough to tell me.
She said that you and your sister liked this spot.

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:27.580
Momo, were you hiding
the disappearance of your sister from Mikan?

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:31.200
Yes. Mikan was one of my sister's disciples,
and I thought she might not take it well.

00:10:31.200 --> 00:10:32.410
That's an understatement.

00:10:32.620 --> 00:10:34.950
Thanks to you, I ended up
having to endure a very cursed shower.

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:39.910
GRUMBLE
GRUMBLE

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:36.620
It totally ruined my clothes.

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:38.410
That explains why you chose to come in your battle form.

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:39.870
Just look at what happened to me!

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:42.000
Anyways, why did you come find me?

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:45.370
You know that my sister was the one
who sealed your father away, right?

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.580
What reason could you have to be friendly with me now?

00:10:57.580 --> 00:10:59.330
Momo, you're my mortal enemy.

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:02.080
Even if we're not friendly, that's more than enough reason
for me to stick close to you.

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:02.910
What's that mean?

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:05.160
I came here because I want to strike a deal with you.

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:10.250
Momo... will you consider quitting being a Magical Girl?

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:13.950
Please make a contract with me and become my vassal!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.410
What are you talking about?

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:33.870
You want to search for Ms. Sakura, right?

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:37.200
But you can't really do anything because
the barrier here obstructs all Magical Girls.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:40.200
Then the solution is simple:
you just have to quit being a Magical Girl!

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:42.620
Quit? But I can't just...

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:43.660
Actually, you can!

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:46.620
If a Magical Girl overwrites their contract
by forging one with a Demon,

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:50.000
their magic attribute will become darkness
and they will stray from the path of light,

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.160
thereby officially making them a vassal of darkness.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:59.660
I dub this the: "Momo Chiyoda Gets Enticed
by the Allure of Darkness Project!"

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:01.450
Uh oh, sorry about that Ancestor.

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:02.660
So dwizzy...

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.450
Ugh... ugh... uuugh...

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:08.500
I finally found a reason to fight.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:10.700
And that's why I need you to stick around, Momo.

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:13.620
To be honest...

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:17.120
...I think your personality is more suited
to being a Demon Girl than a Magical Girl.

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:21.410
I mean, if nobody watches out for you
then your diet just goes straight to Hell!

00:12:21.410 --> 00:12:23.660
And you're really good at coming up
with evil ways to use special powers!

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:26.120
You even exude a way darker aura
than I do most of the time!

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.700
You're not pulling any punches...

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:31.620
I don't think that white and pink theme you have
going on actually fits the color of your personality.

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:34.750
If you fall to the darkness, we'll redesign
your battle form with a simple black as the base!

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:36.580
We can even make your weapon
like a dark katana or something.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:38.660
You're even dragging complaints
about my battle form into this?

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:42.370
Agreeing to become my vassal
is a pretty good deal, you know.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:46.330
I'll help consider the solutions
to whatever tough problems you face.

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:50.370
And I'll also join you in doing the things
that you don't like to do.

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.000
Right now, it seems to me
that you're struggling all by yourself.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.500
It makes me worry about you.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:59.410
But your mother had to raise
2 daughters on her own for 10 years...

00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:03.370
...and on top of that, she had
to lie to you about it the whole time.

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:06.620
No matter what I do, I can't return
those 10 years to your family.

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:08.330
That's why even if you want to strike a deal, I...

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:11.580
So you're just going to give up and run away
because you can't give everything back to us 100%?

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:18.950
I refuse to give up on anything:
My father, undoing the seal, or being with you.

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:21.410
I'm going to find another Demon who lives in this city,

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:25.040
and hopefully through them, get a lead
to find Ms. Sakura, because I owe her so much.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:30.410
I'll get stronger, become even more capable,
and then get back everything that I possibly can!

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:32.950
I'm going to become a true Demon and live greedily!

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:37.250
But I don't think that I can fight
through all the challenges on my own.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:40.620
And since we share the same goals,
I would really like you to fight by my side.

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:43.370
Magical Girl, Momo Chiyoda.

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:46.540
It's time for you to put an end to fighting a solitary war!

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:50.660
Embrace your weakness, give in to utter depravity,
and stray from the path of light.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:52.450
Then let yourself fall into darkness!

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:54.040
Become my...

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:57.450
Become a subordinate of Shadow Mistress Yuko!

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:01.500
There's a lot of benefits
if you agree to become my vassal!

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:05.620
Three meals and one nap a day! And if you agree
to it now, I'll do all garbage removal and dish washing!

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:08.500
Hey Shamiko, you're making a serious commitment
that you can't back out of with all those bonuses!

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:09.160
Gah!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.660
Avoid the effects of the barrier
by becoming a Demon, huh?

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.290
Are you the one who came up with this plan, Ms. Lilith?

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:17.000
Not at all.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:19.290
I did advise Shamiko that it was possible
for you to fall into darkness,

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.950
but the rest of it was all Shamiko's idea
that she put into her own words.

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:26.410
By the way, I personally guarantee you won't suffer
any personality changes by falling into darkness.

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:29.370
I see. So Shamiko said all that herself, huh?

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:31.040
I'm really glad.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:35.500
If this was all just happening according
to Ms. Lilith's script, I would have flung her into space.

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:38.620
Why?! Am I crazy or are you
extra harsh on me all the time?!

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:39.120
Shamiko.

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:39.870
Sigh...

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:39.870
Yes?

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:43.000
I don't need any bonuses
like three meals and one nap a day.

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:46.250
Do you promise that you won't suddenly
disappear on me?

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:47.080
Yes.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:50.500
Regardless of whatever I do from now on,
or whatever I've done in the past,

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.450
will you continue to stay by my side?

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.700
I swear on the box of my father.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.250
That's great.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:01.620
Pause...

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:01.000
No, wait a second.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.080
Something is off here.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:04.250
Nothing this happy could ever possibly befall me.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.450
Huh? This isn't going as planned!

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:07.290
Thinking about it, Ms. Lilith...

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:10.410
...if I go along with this, Shamiko is going
to become the magic ether that I link to

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:12.120
which means I'll end up really weak, right?

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:12.700
Gah!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:13.080
Huh?

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:15.500
Is that true, Ancestor?

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:17.000
Dot, dot, dot.

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:18.000
Tch.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:18.870
TCH...

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:20.000
Yeah, you'll be considerably weaker.

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:20.700
I knew it.

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:23.540
You didn't explain that on purpose, I'll bet.

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:27.160
Ancestor!

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:32.000
Hey Shamiko. Please come and find me
again someday, somewhere.

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.160
Ancestooor...!

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:36.950
That was close, I almost totally fell for it.

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:37.580
Wh-whoa...

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:37.580
Wh-whoa...

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:41.950
But you had a good point, I've been fighting
and contemplating this all on my own for too long.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:43.540
Thank you, Shamiko.

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:49.200
Thinking about it, even if I didn't become a Demon,
you could search the city for other Demons in my place

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:51.330
without being affected by the barrier, right?

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:51.700
Huh?

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:56.200
And in exchange for that, I'll keep you safe
and train you even harder than before.

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:58.080
That's a pretty good deal, don't you think?

00:15:58.080 --> 00:15:59.580
I... I'm not so sure.

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:02.370
Maybe... huh?

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.790
Is it just me or does that change nothing
from how things are now?

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:09.450
If anything, the burden being put on me
seems a bit heavier.

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:11.660
That's not true. You're just imagining it!

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:16.000
If you agree to the deal now, I'll make
your protein shake after training banana flavored!

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.910
But what happened to the idea
of you coming over to the dark side?!

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:18.790
We're putting it on hold.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:24.000
If I went for your deal and became weaker, it would
be impossible for a lot of things to come to fruition.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:27.540
Besides, something just doesn't sit right with me
becoming your subordinate.

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:28.160
But why?!

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:33.000
If you want to make me your vassal,
then you're going to have to beat me first.

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:34.660
I have high expectations, Demon Girl.

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:40.660
HEH
HEH
HEH

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:38.120
So, you're agreeing to become my vassal if I win?

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:40.660
Heh, heh, heh, heh...

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:40.660
Then I'll just dive into your dream
and implant a suggestion in your head and...

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:42.540
That technique is banned.
You have to beat me with only your fists.

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:43.450
That's not fair!

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:45.450
Well that wraps things up, so let's head back.

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:49.330
H-hold on! Nothing is wrapped up!
Are you trying to make a break for it?!

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:53.250
Nope. I won't run away from you anymore, Shamiko.

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:55.660
I'm getting hungry, so let's go back together.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:57.700
Grr... You always throw things out of whack.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:58.330
Huh?

00:16:58.330 --> 00:16:59.660
Just forget it!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:06.000
Dog

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:05.160
Oh dear, it looks like your dinner got all messed up.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.000
It's okay, I'll bring you a fresh bowl of seconds.

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:12.750
Sorry, doggie. I don't get to choose where I come down.

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:18.200
I didn't have the courage to go into the store
with this outfit on, sorry.

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:21.370
That's okay. While I was in there,
I bought something for us to share together.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:22.040
Here.

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:24.160
Double popsicles? Can I really have one?

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:24.580
Yeah.

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:26.040
Let's split it 50/50.

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:27.370
I'll snap it in two!

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:29.040
Just leave it to me!

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:32.370
Hnnngh!

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:33.870
Hnnngh!

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:36.620
Should I do it instead?

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:39.580
Heh, heh, heh, I haven't gotten serious yet.

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:42.330
You just sit back and watch me use my true power!

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:43.830
Oorah!

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:44.830
Sorry, let me help.

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:45.580
SNAP

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:48.120
We're going back to training starting tomorrow.

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.000
Okay, Shadow Mistress?

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:51.200
Grr...

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:55.830
Don't think this means you've won!

00:17:55.830 --> 00:18:01.120
Don't give up, Shamiko! Work to defeat your mortal
enemy and one day become a great ruler of darkness!

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:03.660
Banda Terrace

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:08.080
So, everything about your father being away
for business on a space battleship was a lie!

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:11.370
As your mother, I do feel a bit guilty
about keeping the truth from you.

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:12.620
Yeah, I figured.

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:13.120
Huh?

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:13.910
That's the deal.

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:16.790
I knew that dad was in a situation
where he couldn't come home for a long time.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:18.750
Mom is a terrible liar.

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:23.000
Demon

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:22.450
Space battleships and giant squids.
Who would believe stuff like that?

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:23.000
Huh?

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:26.500
Actually, I'm really into those hardboiled crime novels.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:29.700
So, I thought that dad may have been involved
in something that required prison time.

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:30.500
"Prison"?!

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:34.290
MIKAN

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:33.080
Actually, I'm relieved to know
that he's a lot closer than I thought.

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:34.950
He was right under our nose the whole time.

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:34.950
CLICK
MIKAN

00:18:34.950 --> 00:18:49.540
TRAINING MENU
(MAKE SURE TO DO IT ALL EVERY DAY!!)
PLANK - 15 SECONDS
SQUATS - 15 TIMES
TAKE A 30 MINUTE BREAK
LIFT DUMBBELLS - 5 TIMES
PUNCH PRACTICE - 10 TIMES

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:37.250
You're such a fearless girl, Ryo.

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:40.870
You might take after your father Joshua
in that respect, actually.

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:42.080
"J-Joshua"?!

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:44.200
Our dad had a foreign name?!

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:47.580
Apparently "Joshua" was a very common name
in ancient Mesopotamia.

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:50.000
Wait, so we're half-Mesopotamian?!

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.160
Today is just full of all sorts of surprises.

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:51.750
CLICK

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:55.790
But I saw a lot of documents around here
that listed our dad's name as "Taro Yoshida"!

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:59.330
"Taro Yoshida" was a codename
that your father used while working here in the city.

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:00.000
"Codename"?!

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:02.500
We came up with "Yoshida"
by changing a few letters of "Joshua."

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:05.000
You never considered changing more than just a few?

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:06.950
Mikan.

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:10.040
I'm sorry I never consulted with you about my sister.

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:13.160
Even though I knew she was
a really important person to you, too.

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:14.660
It's fine, don't worry about it.

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:18.290
You were just trying to be considerate
by not aggravating my curse, right?

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:21.410
Sometimes you seem apathetic about things,
but I know you're actually quite considerate.

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:23.540
I suppose.

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:29.040
I think you should let your true self shine
a little more from now on.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:30.330
Keep things simple.

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:32.330
The time cometh.

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:33.700
Go on, have some fruit.

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:34.290
Okay.

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:35.870
These are sour.

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:37.330
That's what makes them so tasty.

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:42.410
After a bunch of crazy stuff happening,
our first semester is finally coming to an end.

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:44.830
Excuse me, Shadow Mistress?

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.040
Are you doing your vacation homework already?

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:47.620
No.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:49.410
This is a letter of challenge.

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:53.750
There's a Magical Girl in Class A, Momo Chiyoda,
who I want to become a denizen of darkness.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.370
So I'm going to challenge her again!

00:19:55.370 --> 00:20:02.830
LETTER OF CHALLENGE:
DEAR MAGICAL GIRL MOMO CHIYODA,
TODAY WILL BE THE DAY I DEFEAT YOU AND MAKE YOU MINE.
FUWAHAHAHAHA!

00:19:55.370 --> 00:19:58.040
"Letter of Challenge: Dear Magical Girl Momo Chiyoda...

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:01.580
A letter of challenge, huh?
Well, do your best to make it really nice.

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:01.580
...Today will be the day I defeat you and make you mine.

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:02.830
Fuwahahaha."

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:06.160
Though speaking as your teacher,
I'm afraid I couldn't give this a passing grade.

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:03.830
FLAP

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:06.700
CLATTER

00:20:06.290 --> 00:20:07.080
Why?!

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:09.200
Because organizing duels is against the law.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:09.790
GAH!

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:09.790
Gah!

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:10.830
Oh?

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:15.330
Our class is already finished for today.
I came here to see what Shamiko was up to.

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:17.410
It looks like she's practicing
how to write a letter or something.

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:18.410
SCRIBBLE
SCRIBBLE
SCRIBBLE

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:20.830
I think it would be better if you picked some
cuter letterhead than that old paper you were using.

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:19.410
SCRIBBLE
SCRIBBLE
SCRIBBLE

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:20.410
SCRIBBLE
SCRIBBLE
SCRIBBLE

