SCRIBBLE
SCRIBBLE
SCRIBBLE

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:24.910
You should start it with a friendly seasonal greeting
and then at the end write something considerate.

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:23.410
SCRIBBLE
SCRIBBLE
SCRIBBLE

