Right.

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:28.330
To: Momo

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:26.910
I finished it!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:28.870
Gallantly, I demand a duel

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:30.450
I go at it, but I lose

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:31.660
It's beyond disappointing

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:34.790
Um, teacher, don't you think this pushes the envelope
a bit too much for a letter of challenge?

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:33.200
Shift away from that grief

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:34.620
Even when I’m feeling curt

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:36.500
I’ll express myself with that tail

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:35.700
Cute!

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:37.330
Cute!

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:37.330
But dear, envelopes are stationary.

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:40.080
There's a party in the neighborhood

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:41.660
Even the dogs are going bow-wow

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.500
Hey, Momo!

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:42.950
Each and every last one

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:43.870
Oh good, I'm glad you haven't gone home yet.

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:44.410
For all four seasons

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:45.250
You should read this!

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:47.700
When you fail just laugh it off

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:48.200
Huh? Why are you wearing a different color than normal?

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:54.200
Connecting our hearts like that time once before

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:50.620
Am I not allowed to change my wardrobe a little?

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:52.080
I think I like this more than the usual.

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:55.040
To: Momo

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:54.330
Just read it!

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:55.040
A letter?

00:20:54.620 --> 00:21:00.040
With the miracle that we met in this town

00:20:55.040 --> 00:21:04.700
Dearest Momo,
How is the heat of summer treating you?
You seemed a bit down in the dumps a few
days ago, so I'm showing some demonic concern
for you.

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:58.830
"Dearest Momo, how is the heat of summer treating you?"

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:04.000
"You seemed a bit down in the dumps a few days ago,
so I'm showing some demonic concern for you."

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:06.370
Shamiko, does this mean you're worried about me?

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:06.750
Grant this wish

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:08.410
No! Just stop, I changed my mind!

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:09.540
Shoulder those tires and go full throttle

